From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marc Lainez <marc.lainez@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 08:48:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] pipeline: simple: Support the MediaTek MT8127 camsys

The MT8127 camsys driver captures raw Bayer frames from a CSI-2 receiver
without a hardware ISP; process them with the software ISP.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
index efb0705..68bfa7a 100644
--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/simple.cpp
@@ -253,6 +253,7 @@ static const SimplePipelineInfo supportedDevices[] = {
 	{ "imx7-csi", { { "pxp", 1 } }, false },
 	{ "intel-ipu6", {}, true },
 	{ "j721e-csi2rx", {}, true },
+	{ "mtk-camsys", {}, true },
 	{ "mtk-seninf", { { "mtk-mdp", 3 } }, false },
 	{ "mxc-isi", {}, false },
 	{ "qcom-camss", {}, true },
